OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate rape of girl,
OL,4,A16, in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old girl has been raped after
OL,7,Fshe was approached by a group of three
OL,8,Fmen in a park, police have said.
OL,10,FDetectives launched an investigation
OL,11,Fafter it was reported the group came up
OL,12,Fto the teenager before one of them
OL,13,Fattacked her between 21:40 and 22:45
OL,14,FBST on Saturday in Broughton Brook,
OL,15,FMilton Keynes.
OL,17,FThe group consisted of one white and
OL,18,Ftwo black males, with Thames Valley
OL,19,FPolice saying the male involved is
OL,20,Fdescribed as black, in his late teens
OL,21,For early 20s, had his hair covered and
OL,22,Fwas dressed in dark clothes.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
