OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate rape of girl,
OL,4,A16, in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Amy Banks urged anyone in the
OL,7,Fpark at the time to contact them if
OL,8,Fthey spotted something suspicious or
OL,9,Fhad information, and said officers were
OL,10,Fsupporting the victim.
